{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00442",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.94,
      "end_seconds": 4.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "Hi, doctor. Long queue outside, but here I am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.25,
      "end_seconds": 8.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "Yes, do sit. Tell me what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 9.6,
      "end_seconds": 13.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "Doctor, I'm just here to help with the details."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 13.92,
      "end_seconds": 16.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "Good, that'll be useful. Pull up a chair."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 17.84,
      "end_seconds": 23.15,
      "duration_seconds": 5.31,
      "text": "So, I've been feeling a bit dizzy after taking all my tablets, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.72,
      "end_seconds": 26.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Is this recent, or has it been a while?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.74,
      "end_seconds": 30.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "It's been about three months now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.35,
      "end_seconds": 34.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "How would you describe it, mild, moderate, severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 35.25,
      "end_seconds": 42.78,
      "duration_seconds": 7.53,
      "text": "I mean, a six out of ten, I suppose. I've also had dry mouth, for two months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.71,
      "end_seconds": 45.57,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "Any an upset stomach as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 46.19,
      "end_seconds": 49.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "Yeah. Five days, you know, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.9,
      "end_seconds": 53.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Let me double-check something in your record."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.83,
      "end_seconds": 55.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "Of course, take your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 63.43,
      "end_seconds": 68.51,
      "duration_seconds": 5.08,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. Let me check a few things. Any vomiting or low mood?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 69.86,
      "end_seconds": 72.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "No, no vomiting or low mood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.99,
      "end_seconds": 76.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "Alright. Have you had any fainting, chest pain or black stools?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.01,
      "end_seconds": 82.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "No fainting, chest pain or black stools, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.06,
      "end_seconds": 86.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "What about your general health, any conditions you're being treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 91.28,
      "end_seconds": 96.92,
      "duration_seconds": 5.64,
      "text": "I have high cholesterol, for two years. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.14,
      "end_seconds": 112.17,
      "duration_seconds": 14.03,
      "text": "It's quite normal to feel unsure at this point. People often expect an instant answer, but a good assessment usually has a few stages, and today is mainly about narrowing things down and making a sensible plan together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.18,
      "end_seconds": 114.78,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "That's reassuring to hear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.07,
      "end_seconds": 120.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "Do you have any allergies to medicines, food, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.68,
      "end_seconds": 124.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Yes, eggs, it gives me stomach cramps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.52,
      "end_seconds": 129.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "Sorry, I'm just writing a few notes, bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.57,
      "end_seconds": 131.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "No problem, take your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.98,
      "end_seconds": 137.64,
      "duration_seconds": 5.66,
      "text": "Any medication at the moment, including things from the pharmacy? Take your time, there's no rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.73,
      "end_seconds": 141.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "It's rosuvastatin, 10 milligrams, at night."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.6,
      "end_seconds": 145.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "Is the room warm enough for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.62,
      "end_seconds": 147.51,
      "duration_seconds": 1.89,
      "text": "It's perfect, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.63,
      "end_seconds": 150.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.77,
      "text": "Any operations in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 150.82,
      "end_seconds": 154.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "Just my thyroid operated on, a long time ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.81,
      "end_seconds": 157.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "One moment, the system's being slow today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.11,
      "end_seconds": 158.86,
      "duration_seconds": 0.75,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.07,
      "end_seconds": 171.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Okay, how about smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 172.31,
      "end_seconds": 175.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "I stopped smoking about two years back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.55,
      "end_seconds": 193.14,
      "duration_seconds": 16.59,
      "text": "Let me explain how I'm thinking about this. When someone has symptoms like these, we first look for the common and treatable causes, and only then for the rarer ones. That's why I'm going step by step rather than ordering everything at once."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 194.57,
      "end_seconds": 196.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.63,
      "end_seconds": 199.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Alright, I'll take a few measurements first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 209.53,
      "end_seconds": 211.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Okay, give me a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.32,
      "end_seconds": 243.21,
      "duration_seconds": 11.89,
      "text": "Okay: blood pressure 119 over 77, saturation 97 percent, temperature is 36.7 degrees, respiratory rate 17, heart rate 69. I'll try to keep this as efficient as I can."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 244.71,
      "end_seconds": 246.67,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Thank you, I appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.04,
      "end_seconds": 250.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Are you comfortable? Do you want some water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 250.96,
      "end_seconds": 254.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "Yes, some water would be nice, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.95,
      "end_seconds": 262.25,
      "duration_seconds": 7.3,
      "text": "So, based on your history, my working impression is possible side effects from too many medicines. I'd also keep dehydration in mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 263.52,
      "end_seconds": 265.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Oh, doctor, is this dangerous?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.41,
      "end_seconds": 284.68,
      "duration_seconds": 17.27,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with possible side effects from too many medicines do well once it's treated properly. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've been feeling a bit dizzy after taking all your tablets for about three months, and no low mood or vomiting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 285.46,
      "end_seconds": 287.05,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "Yes, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 287.88,
      "end_seconds": 300.45,
      "duration_seconds": 12.57,
      "text": "Just so you know how the rest of the visit will go: I'll finish my notes, we'll agree on the plan, and the front desk will help with anything that needs booking. You shouldn't need to chase anything yourself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 300.91,
      "end_seconds": 303.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "Good, I was wondering how this would go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 304.85,
      "end_seconds": 307.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange an ECG for dizziness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 308.86,
      "end_seconds": 311.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "Alright. When can I do that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.57,
      "end_seconds": 320.3,
      "duration_seconds": 7.73,
      "text": "I'm going to order blood tests, for medication review. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 321.85,
      "end_seconds": 324.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "Alright. When can I do that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 324.89,
      "end_seconds": 351.7,
      "duration_seconds": 26.81,
      "text": "Use a weekly pill organiser so the doses don't get mixed. Bring every box and bottle you have at home to the next visit, even the herbal ones, and we'll sort them together. Try to keep a simple diary of when it happens and what you were doing, and bring it to the next visit. Avoid taking any extra painkillers on top of what I'm prescribing without checking with us."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 352.87,
      "end_seconds": 358.33,
      "duration_seconds": 5.46,
      "text": "Please don't sit on it if the symptoms get worse. That's the point to get seen urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 359.28,
      "end_seconds": 361.18,
      "duration_seconds": 1.9,
      "text": "Yes, I'll do that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 362.51,
      "end_seconds": 365.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again in a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 366.8,
      "end_seconds": 367.5,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 368.24,
      "end_seconds": 372.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "Okay, summarise it for me, what's the plan from your side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 373.27,
      "end_seconds": 377.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.2,
      "text": "So, I come back in a week. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 381.19,
      "end_seconds": 383.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Good. Look after yourself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 384.56,
      "end_seconds": 388.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "I think that's clear. Thank you for being so thorough."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 388.78,
      "end_seconds": 389.51,
      "duration_seconds": 0.73,
      "text": "Take care."
    }
  ]
}